meta {
  name: 22 Auto Return
  seq: 22
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  1. Automatic return: the Nth DELIVERY_FAILED on an InTransit shipment returns it to the
     sender in the same request (reason MAX_ATTEMPTS_REACHED). Limit = the shipment's
     maxDeliveryAttempts, else Returns:MaxDeliveryAttempts (3); 0 = never.
  2. Terminal events: after DELIVERED / RETURNED, new manual / scan events are rejected
     (ITEM_JOURNEY_ENDED) until the item joins an open shipment again.

  Uses the network and return lanes from 18 and 21, and the delivered item from 12.
}
